# LF everywhere, including Windows checkouts: charter copies are verified byte-for-byte
# against docs/charter/SHA256SUMS, and spec/code hashes should not depend on the OS.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.parquet binary
# Windows scripts shipped next to QuantLab.exe: cmd.exe and Windows PowerShell expect CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
